        "explanation": "Volume of the large sphere (V_sphere) = (4/3)πR³\nR = 12 cm\nV_sphere = (4/3)π(12)³ = (4/3)π(1728) = 4 * 576π = 2304π cm³\n\nVolume of one small cone (V_cone) = (1/3)πr²h\nr = 3 cm, h = 4 cm\nV_cone = (1/3)π(3)²(4) = (1/3)π(9)(4) = (1/3)π(36) = 12π cm³\n\nNumber of cones = V_sphere / V_cone\nNumber of cones = (2304π) / (12π)\nNumber of cones = 2304 / 12\nNumber of cones = 192",
